<html>
<head><title>misnested inline formatting</title></head>
<body>
<b><i><u>alpha</b> beta</i> gamma</u>
<font color=red size=+3><big><small>delta</font> epsilon</small></big>
<p><a href="x" a=1><em>link <strong>inside</a> after</strong></em>
<dl>
<dt>term<dd>definition
<dt><dd><ol start="not-a-number"><li>one<li value="--">two</ol>
</dl>
</body>
</html>